            "description": "<p>Morning Brief host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> takes a look at some of Friday morning's <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/trending/\">trending tickers</a> and stories.</p>\n<p>PNC Financial (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PNC\">PNC</a>) stock is rising on the company's fourth quarter earnings results.</p>\n<p>BYD (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BYD\">BYD</a>) stock is jumping on reports that the electric vehicle (EV)\u2013maker is in talks to partner with Ford (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/F\">F</a>).</p>\n<p>ImmunityBio (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/IBRX\">IBRX</a>) stock is skyrocketing, already doubling so far this year.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
